Z||000011||Mr.Frosty||11-26-2001||12:31 AM||||Actually,I used to have an idea for those things.The fiero instrument panels with the sidelit gauges,and 85 mph speedo's.You could use these inside of the instrument panel to brightly illuminate the gauges.You could wire them into the instrument panel,since the power inverter uses a 12 volt power source "perfect".Use the bright blue with some white face inserts and you have cool effect.I'm not going this route now,because I just replaced my instruments with a 120 mph backlit panel and rally gauges.Hmmmm<P>------------------<BR>85 GT Turbo intercooled||||reg||1
